      "semantics": "CONTRACT-082 revision 0.2 and CONTRACT-906. Native retention, shape derivation and untouched-only export consistency are owned by shared Rust. Original UTF-8 text (including optional BOM, whitespace, escape spelling and line endings) is retained. Named dataset columns and widget query outputs use core Records/Fields and references; no parallel field dictionary or SQL/type inference. Changes without a qualified native rewrite fail export. Native rendering and Databricks acceptance remain unverified. The PR42 umf.dashboard 0.1 projection is a separate legacy compatibility view.",
